        "title": "Direct Meds ® | USA OFFICIAL SITE",
        "meta_descr": "DirectMeds is a telehealth platform that connects patients with licensed medical professionals for weight management solutions. The company specializes in GLP-1 medications including semaglutide and tirzepatide, offering online consultations and prescription delivery. It operates as a technology platform that facilitates access to third-party pharmacies and medical providers",
        "header_custom": "",
