          "_name": "content5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"1\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"11\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>Article Title</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\">\n                    Enter your subtitle here\n                </h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><b>⚡\n</b><br><b>Same-Day Consultations Available\n</b><br>Most GLP-1 telehealth providers take 24–72 hours to review intake forms. DirectMeds offers same-day provider consultations for patients who submit during business hours, making it one of the fastest paths from sign-up to prescription approval.\n<br>\n<br><b>💊\n</b><br><b>Both Semaglutide &amp; Tirzepatide Offered\n</b><br>DirectMeds gives patients access to both compounded semaglutide and tirzepatide, allowing providers to tailor medication choice to the patient's health profile, weight loss goals, and budget preferences.\n<br>\n<br><b>💰\n<br>Competitively Priced Plans\n</b><br>DirectMeds' entry-level plan undercuts many telehealth competitors while still including a licensed physician consultation. For price-sensitive patients, the value proposition is clear — effective GLP-1 access without the premium mark-up.\n<br>\n<b><br>🚚\n<br>Fast Home Delivery\n</b><br>Once prescribed, medications ship directly from partnered compounding pharmacies with expedited processing. Most patients report receiving their first shipment within 3–7 business days — faster than the industry average of 5–10 days.\n<br>\n<br><b>🩺\n<br>Licensed U.S. Providers Only\n</b><br>Every prescription issued through DirectMeds is reviewed and approved by a licensed U.S. physician or nurse practitioner. No algorithms, no offshore providers — genuine clinical oversight on every patient file.\n<br>\n<b><br>📱\n<br>Streamlined Digital Experience\n<br></b>DirectMeds' intake process is built for efficiency — a clean digital form, fast provider review, and a patient portal that keeps medication management simple. Minimal friction from sign-up to first injection.<br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
